{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222130","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1522213001:1":{"text":"Perseus sure has a reputation in this city.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯在城内的声望还真高。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x039646C4386D5A71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522213002:0":{"text":"Young or old, everyone's heard he won the battle. They believe he stands for justice. That he'll pull Halia out of this mess.","source_cn":"无论男女老少，都知道他打了胜仗，坚信他会守卫正义，能带...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7AE5EE81A22CFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522213003:0":{"text":"Even that lieutenant of his is basking in his glory.","source_cn":"连带着那位副将也沾了不少光啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7AAFF08CD621C09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522213004:0":{"text":"Perseus has always fought to protect the commoners. The people love him for it, and rightly so.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯一直在为平民争取生的权利，受人敬仰与爱戴是应当的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783AD6D195925E01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522213005:0":{"text":"But Lygos...","source_cn":"但隆尔副将……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAB1BFB946EAE42","variant_status":""